OL,3,GNEWSAPark home owners want 'unfair'
OL,4,Aselling fee scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy describes his static home in
OL,7,FLeicestershire as his "castle".
OL,9,FHe is one of an estimated 160,000 park
OL,10,Fhome residents in England, attracted by
OL,11,Fthe affordability, security, sense of
OL,12,Fcommunity and picturesque surroundings
OL,13,Fthat this form of accommodation can
OL,14,Fprovide.
OL,16,FBut Andy says he feels "stuck" on a
OL,17,Fsite where the landowner would take a
OL,18,F10% commission if he sells his home.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
