OL,3,GNEWSAPark home owners want 'unfair'
OL,4,Aselling fee scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter carrying out a review of the
OL,7,Fsales commission arrangement earlier
OL,8,Fthis year, the government is facing
OL,9,Fcalls to scrap it.
